🔹 Linux & Cron Jobs
 • How to check service status?
 • How to schedule a cron job?
 • Write a script to schedule a job every minute.
 • How to check CPU and memory usage?
 • How do you check load average?

🔹 Terraform vs Ansible
 • What’s the difference between Terraform and Ansible?
 • How will you install a package on multiple remote Linux machines?
 • What is the module name for installing packages in Ansible?
 • What are handlers in Ansible?

🔹 AWS & EC2 Troubleshooting
 • If a customer reports they can’t SSH into an EC2 instance, how will you resolve it?

🔹 Ports & Networking
 • How to check active ports?
 • How do you check ports running on another machine?
 • How to check network interface?
 • What is a subnet?
 • What is a gateway?
 • What is DNS?
